{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17307","headline":"送张周二秀才谒宣州薛侍郎 · 权德舆","name":"送张周二秀才谒宣州薛侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"儒衣两少年，春棹毂溪船。\n湖月供诗兴，岚风费酒钱。\n上帆涵浦岸，欹枕傲晴天。\n不用愁羁旅，宣城太守贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}